  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/tCsPgH8k/Rappenem-s-Reforge-Banner-Sunset.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">描述</span></strong></h2>\n<p>Rappenem's Reforge 是一款资源包，旨在为游戏资产赋予<strong>焕然一新的外观</strong>，同时保留经典且<strong>充满趣味的 Minecraft 风格</strong>！新的贴图忠实于原版的基础分辨率，但色彩范围更广、细节更丰富、设计更精美，带有一丝中世纪/奇幻的氛围！</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">链接与信息！</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>⚠️ 需要安装以下模组才能解锁 Rappenem's Reforge 的所有功能 ⚠️</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ETF</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EMF</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>如果你想关注该资源包的进度，并加入一群酷酷的艺术家社区，欢迎加入我的<span style=\"color:#3598db\"> <strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2hvKFfPzQt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a></strong></span>！</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>我还在我的 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/rappenems-port-156065827\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span> 上开发该资源包的基岩版（PC/移动端）移植版本，在那里你还可以获得抢先体验、额外内容等更多福利！</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d9c6987ff279961b2887ccc21d54dd3b.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Rappenem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1244413/description_8395bb4a-75ce-4c55-ba47-f8cd006f472b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"106\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2hvKFfPzQt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1244413/description_d7bb3dc8-a9da-4494-8593-d323d577bc64.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"106\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252frappenems_reforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1244413/description_71a901f9-d369-4bc0-bfd2-c4517339b1a2.png\" width=\"99\" height=\"106\"></a></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fRapps_Reforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1244413/description_89b6147f-fba3-403e-a0dc-85811f933277.png\" width=\"99\" height=\"106\"></a></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">内容概览</span></strong></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">全新设计的用户界面，拥有更多的细节与个性！&nbsp;</span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/GtTTd7w9/Full-GUI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1132\"></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/vHxrkHsV/Ender-Dragon-Boss-Bar.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/hGg6jV5S/Mob-Effects-Presentation.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"880\" height=\"800\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">超过 200 种重新绘制的物品！</span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1244413/description_9e541f28-aa4c-41b3-9029-c8793edad98f.gif\" width=\"637\" height=\"494\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/ZRwdvmfp/Item-Reforges.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"648\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">全套重设计的盔甲，每种都有独特的造型和氛围，并与对应的工具相匹配！</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kGHNyR98/Armor-Items-Showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"797\" height=\"800\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/xTMFj9Fn/2025-08-03-11-50-06.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NFwmdv8k/2025-08-03-11-56-24.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/qMz8ntHJ/Netherite-Armor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"673\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">100+ 种重新绘制的方块，拥有更多样化/独特的纹理</span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/qMV3t1w5/all.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Mpv0rYzv/2026-01-0315-43-11-ezgif-com-video-to-gif-converter.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/gk0Bq3yP/TNT.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NM2KFXHh/Screenshot-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"672\"></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/zfHswTrW/Doors-And-Trapdoors.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">更多精彩即将呈现！</span></strong></h2>",
